      "alt": "The name of the channel was: ¿Model Name-Hold My BeeriAnd people were just throwing that at the hardest problems they could. And people didn't think the model was going to do these things. And we had this collective experience of people's hardest research problems from their academic career. The model was just knocking down one after the other. Many different fields. It was incredible to watch. And two nights in a row, I was up most of the night because I was so excited I couldn't go to bed. It was...\nMany of those problems that we published, many other things And I was tremendously excited and happy. But I also had much more sadness and melancholy, and a feeling of something ending than I was expecting So again, I agree. This is the right thing, o behalf of the world. And also, I agree that this is just the shape of reality and nothing that anyone can stop, or should stop. But, I do have real—",
